      },
      "explain": {
        "text": "$e^{1 + i\\pi} = e \\cdot e^{i\\pi} = -e$. The real part of the exponent sets the modulus, $e^1 \\approx 2.7183$; the imaginary part sets the angle, $\\pi$."
